@sgspe_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Login (copie o token da resposta para @token)
POST {{sgspe_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@exemplo.com", "password": "troque-esta-senha" }

###
@token = cole-o-token-aqui

### Empresas (Admin)
GET {{sgspe_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

